lib/WWW/Chain/UA/LWP.pm:13-27 and lib/WWW/Chain.pm:63-66 set no timeout. The default of LWP is 180 seconds per request, and request_with_lwp builds the user agent itself, so the caller cannot change the timeout.

Failure case: a hanging server blocks the chain for three minutes per request, without any way to break it.

Decide: the requests of a chain get a timeout (30 seconds).

